<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier Corp rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Frontier Corp rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Frontier Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited Frontier's forecast of lower than expected fourth quarter revenues and earnings.</p>
<p>-- Cut fourth quarter earnings per share estimate to $0.32 from $0.44.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.65 from $1.85.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 20-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
